	(text "Supplying the motors:\n- through Vbatt (from the XT60): R28 must be populated\n- through Dxl: R28 must be removed.\n\nMotor communication:\n- USB (Dynamixel-TTL converter): R15 must be populated\n- Dynamixel: R15 must be removed."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
